{"summary": "In this room, looking from the entrance, three deep brown leather armchairs—each tufted and luxurious—are positioned 0.5 meters from three mahogany vintage tables, which are distressed and ornate. On each vintage table rests a dark gray ceramic ashtray, sleek and minimalist, while a fourth ashtray is placed on a polished white marble side table next to the first armchair. Two black moody pendant lights, angular and industrial, hang 1.5 meters above the first two vintage tables. Behind each armchair, a deep blue thematic wall art, textured and evocative, is mounted, with two additional pieces adjacent to a rich walnut wooden bookshelf—carved and stately—and opposite an emerald green velvet ottoman, button-tufted and opulent. Three more ottomans are positioned 0.3 meters in front of the armchairs, while a fourth sits near the bookshelf. A gleaming clear crystal decanter, faceted and cut glass, is displayed on the second marble side table."}
```

